  "section": "9.56",
  "rulesText": "Ingested Poison\n\nA creature subjected to Torpor poison must succeed on a DC 15 Constitution saving throw or have the Poisoned condition for 4d6 hours. The creature's Speed is halved while the creature is Poisoned in this way."
}
